                <p><strong>Real Estate Developers (Dwarka, Rohini, Narela):</strong> 50-500+ workers across sites. BOCW, PF/ESI, Delhi min wage, RERA cost allocation.</p><p><strong>General Contractors (DDA, CPWD, Delhi Metro):</strong> Direct workers + sub-contractors. Principal employer compliance even for sub-contractor workers.</p><p><strong>Sub-Contractors/Labour Suppliers:</strong> Contract Labour Licence. Muster rolls. PF/ESI deductions. Default = principal employer liable.</p><p><strong>Infrastructure (Metro, Roads, Flyovers):</strong> Government project CPWD norms. Additional documentation. Large seasonal workforces.</p><p><strong>Commercial Developers (Aerocity, Saket, CP):</strong> Higher-value projects. Institutional investor/bank audit requirements. Larger workforces.</p><p><strong>Interior Fit-Out/Renovation:</strong> Often overlooked but BOCW applies for 10+ workers on any construction site.</p>

